window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A collection of the high-stakes, high-octane, sexy-as-sin romantic suspense series My Sinful Men. Each book follows a new couple, while a continuous mystery storyline runs across this utterly addictive family saga!</p> <p>This explosive saga begins with <i>My Sinful Nights</i>, a sexy, emotional, heart-stopping second romance.</p> <p>Ten years ago, I let the love of my life slip through my fingers. It’s my greatest regret, especially since she’s all but disappeared. When she walks back into my world unexpectedly, I have one mission—win her back. Whatever it takes.</p> <p><i>My Sinful Desire</i>, a passionate, emotional, sexy-as-sin romance.</p> <p>I live my life by a few simple rules—let no one in, trust only my family, and don’t ever spend more than three nights with a woman. Those are easy enough to abide by until I meet gorgeous, captivating, and absolutely brilliant Sophie Winston and fall into a dangerous romance with the sister of the detective investigating my father’s murder....</p> <p><i>My Sinful Longing</i>, a sexy, emotional, friends-to-lovers romance.</p> <p>Some women are just off-limits. But that doesn’t stop me from wanting my good friend, Elle Mariano. The thing is, she’s fighting the demons of her past and so am I. And it turns out the bastards who tried to tear my family apart years ago are tailing both of us now. Our every move....</p> <p><i>My Sinful Love</i>, a second chance with the one who got away. She was my \"what if?\" girl. The one I longed for. The one I tried to find again after she left for the other side of the world. Now, years later, fate has swept the only woman I’ve ever loved back into my life. And she’s holding the final piece of the puzzle to solving the mystery.</p> <p>This collection also includes the novella<i> My Sinful Temptation</i>.</p>"; 
